          <span class="gmark">G</span>
          <span>Genable</span>
        </a>
        <p style="margin-top: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55;">
          Use your model to plan, build, and refine native Figma structure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4>Product</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/features">Agent capabilities</a></li>
          <li><a href="/quickstart#plugin">Figma plugin</a></li>
          <li><a href="/quickstart#mcp">MCP bridge</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4>Resources</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/quickstart">Quickstart</a></li>
          <li><a href="/docs">Docs</a></li>
          <li><a href="/examples">Examples</a></li>
          <li><a href="/changelog">Changelog</a></li>
